WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:09.768
Yes — growing out your bangs is one preparation step we really want to emphasize for wedding-parent hair.

2
00:00:10.104 --> 00:00:17.496
Once the wedding date is set, most people know to grow out the back of their hair, but few think about their bangs.

3
00:00:17.832 --> 00:00:26.880
Bangs need to reach about chin length so they blend seamlessly into the side hair with a smooth curve, giving an elegant style.

4
00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:38.040
Short bangs hold poorly and tend to fall out of place during the ceremony, and forcing them down with spray only makes them look stiff and unnatural.

5
00:00:38.376 --> 00:00:43.920
Once your wedding date is set, hold off on cutting your bangs and let them grow,

6
00:00:44.256 --> 00:00:52.248
since an artist can adjust long hair on the day, but there's no way to add length to hair that's too short.
